[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448955417","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109124#issuecomment-3448955417","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109124","id":3448955417,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NkuIZ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-26T22:01:43Z","updated_at":"2025-10-26T22:01:43Z","body":"This is a pretty straight-forward change, but it potentially involves lots of bikeshedding 🤔\r\nPersonally I use Ctrl+U shortcut for this action.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448955417/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3449048652","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109124#issuecomment-3449048652","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109124","id":3449048652,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NlE5M","user":{"login":"MrCook284","id":99657402,"node_id":"U_kgDOBfCmug","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99657402?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284","html_url":"https://github.com/MrCook284","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-27T00:14:55Z","updated_at":"2025-10-27T00:14:55Z","body":"The main reason for making it CTRL+SHIFT+X is to follow the right click context menu to make sure that it would cause little debate to what the bind should be.\r\n<img width=\"233.5\" height=\"317.5\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-10-26 18-04-47\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5845d536-6c3f-45f7-9579-002f64547bb8\" />\r\nI was hoping that having a default in the first place would be better than having nothing set since this feature is powerful.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3449048652/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5332184064","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109124#issuecomment-5332184064","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109124","id":5332184064,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPdKsAA","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-18T18:09:41Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T18:09:41Z","body":"I would strongly associate `Ctrl + X` with cutting, which makes it feel unfitting for this purpose to me.\r\n\r\nOverall, **I think I agree with KoBeWi that `Ctrl + U` is a good shortcut to use**. It makes sense that the \"U\" stands for \"unique\", whereas the \"X\" in `Ctrl + X` doesn't have an immediate meaning to me.\r\n\r\nI'd also considered proposing `Ctrl + 5` or `Shift + 5`, since 5 is the key you press with Shift to get the `%` symbol... but that's not universal across other keyboards, so it's probably a no-go. And `Shift + 5` specifically appears to already be bound to **Canvas Item Editor > Zoom to 3.125%**.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5332184064/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5701858934","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109124#issuecomment-5701858934","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109124","id":5701858934,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABU9t2dg","user":{"login":"MrCook284","id":99657402,"node_id":"U_kgDOBfCmug","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99657402?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284","html_url":"https://github.com/MrCook284","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrCook284/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-16T17:38:40Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T17:41:51Z","body":"You make a good point about cutting I didn't think about it in that way.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5701858934/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]